-- FitKu: seed the Pro-only expansion of the shared `foods` catalog.
-- Generated programmatically from landing/makanan-indonesia-1.html (foodDatabase) +
-- landing/makanan-indonesia-2.html (foodDatabasePart3) — not hand-transcribed. See
-- the conversion script run for this migration for exact extraction/mapping logic.
--
-- Source pool: 2676 raw entries (2251 + 425).
-- After category mapping, within-pool dedup, and dedup against the existing 193
-- core items (all by case-insensitive exact name match): 2586 rows below.
--
-- Category mapping (fixed table, no keyword heuristics — the source data only has 5
-- coarse categories, with no reliable way to auto-split "gorengan"/"sup_kuah" out of
-- them): Makanan->nasi_karbo, Lauk->lauk, Sayur->sayur, Kudapan->camilan, Minuman->minuman.
-- gorengan/sup_kuah intentionally receive no new rows from this migration.
--
-- serving_grams is parsed from the free-text serving label via a (\d+)\s*g|ml regex,
-- falling back to 100 when unparseable (e.g. "10 Tusuk") — a documented lossy default,
-- not a precise conversion.
--
-- IDs (pro-food-0001 onward) are generated ONCE by the conversion script and hardcoded
-- below — never regenerated at runtime, matching the precedent already established for
-- this catalog (see fitku_food_additions.ts / docs/FITKU_DEVELOPMENT_LOG.md 2026-08-2x).
-- Re-running this migration would fail on the foods.id primary key, same safeguard as
-- 0002_seed_foods.sql.

